  "rationale": {
    "catan": "Preserve all existing board/hand fields and placement-independent observations; no source or native scene contract change.",
    "rummikub": "Preserve visible tile number/color/face in table and private rack; rack itself has no invented tile properties.",
    "sagrada": "In each dice area request canonical dieColor and dieValue; observedColor is a duplicate free color note. All window/tool/private fields remain requested.",
    "hanabi": "In fireworks and discard, request visible face/suit/number. Do not ask for an additional card printedName to reproduce those same identity facts. Tokens retain their own distinct fields.",
    "azul": "Current pinned original-base colour tiles are identified by face and tileColor, not an individual printedName (tiles sourceText: colour and current factory/centre/pattern/wall/floor). offer boards are factories (factoryLabel); pattern/wall boards are personal boards (printedName, sideLabel, boardSide, scoreTrack). Quantity, first marker, board side, score, geometry and physical bag preservation remain unchanged. No occluded-pile identity rule is inferred."
  }
